WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.069
The last train leaves in ten minutes.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.499
Mira has lost her ticket.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.834
Leo offers to help her find it.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.164
They check the bench beside the platform.

5
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.764
The ticket is under Mira's bag.

6
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.744
They board the train together, just in time.
